  "details": "- Add Alma9_8ESU; carry the tuxcare9.6esu CVE fixes\n- CVE-2025-27830: fix potential buffer overflow with DollarBlend in font\n  serialization\n- CVE-2025-27831: prevent Unicode decoding overrun in txtwrite/docxwrite devices\n- CVE-2025-27835: fix confusion between bytes and shorts in glyph to Unicode\n  conversion\n- CVE-2025-27836: fix potential print buffer overflow in BJ10V device\n- CVE-2024-29508: fix heap-based pointer disclosure in pdf_base_font_alloc\n- CVE-2025-48708: fix argument sanitization to redact values supplied with '#'\n  separator\n- CVE-2024-46955: out-of-bounds read when reading a color in Indexed color space\n- CVE-2025-59798: buffer overrun in pdf_write_cmap in the pdfwrite device\n- CVE-2025-59799: stack buffer overflow in pdfmark_coerce_dest in the pdfwrite\n  device\n- CVE-2023-52722: reject non-standard eexec seeds in SAFER mode (psi/zmisc1.c)",
